# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-glowing
name: Glowing
polarity: positive
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: moment
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  A Light Source: Light Level +1 in a Minor Sphere centred on you (not past Normal).
text: >
  Glowing: This Transformation projects a glowing aura of light.
  –Effect: You are a Light Source that increases the Light Level by 1 in a Minor Sphere AoE (centered on you). This increase to Light Level cannot cause the Light Level to exceed Normal.

